# Phrases which, if present in a post, mean this sentinel must NEVER upvote it.
#
# Copy to `never_upvote_strings.txt` (gitignored) and edit. One phrase per
# line, searched for in the post's title and body as a plain substring,
# case-insensitively. Re-read automatically on change — no restart needed,
# even in webhook mode.
#
# Only whole-line comments: a line whose first character is `#`. There are
# no trailing comments, because a phrase may contain `#`. To match a phrase
# that starts with `#` (a hashtag), or one with meaningful spaces around it,
# wrap it in double quotes.
#
# This list only suppresses upvotes. It does not cause downvotes, and it does
# not stop JUNK marking, language tags or PII flags.

# limited time offer
# "#sponsored"
# " scam "
